<body class="marketing-page">
	<SiteNav />

	<main>

	<section class="hero alt-hero">
		<div class="hero-badge">Alternatives · Self-Hosted</div>
		<h1>Migadu alternative.<br/><span>Flat-rate ethos, your server.</span></h1>
		<p class="alt-lead">
			Migadu fans love what they stand for: flat pricing instead of per-mailbox billing,
